    <preface>
      <p>Energy Grants and Other Legislation Amendment (Ethanol and Biodiesel) Act 2015</p>
      <p>No. 81, 2015</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to energy grants, customs and excise, and for other purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-1">Part 1</ref>—Main amendments	3</p>
      <p>Customs Act 1901	3</p>
      <p>Excise Act 1901	4</p>
      <p>Fuel Tax Act 2006	5</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-2">Part 2</ref>—Repeals	8</p>
      <p>Energy Grants (Cleaner Fuels) Scheme Act 2004	8</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-3">Part 3</ref>—Consequential amendments	9</p>
      <p>Coastal Trading (Revitalising Australian Shipping) Act 2012	9</p>
      <p>Fuel Tax Act 2006	9</p>
      <p>Product Grants and Benefits Administration Act 2000	9</p>
